  "notes": "Deduplicated across 8 sub-families. Exact opcodes/payloads are static; colour/segment writes for bulblightstringv2/bulblightv3 are produced by base ColorModeControllerConfig/Bytes (0x15 sub-mode variants) and are runtime-dependent (IC/piece count). bulblightstringv1 CmdStatusV0.parseJson and legacy Support.d switch are JADX stubs. H7022 uses IotMsg V0; bulblightv1 V1; stringv2/v3 V2. ptReal carries base64 20-byte BLE frames. Solar H3210/H3520 are BLE-only with battery history op 0xAC/0x0E and brightness strategy 0x33/0x43."
